{"id": "t028-057", "text": "Ming's exhibition opening is next Thursday at 7, she's showing three of her big canvases. I'm bringing flowers. She's so anxious about it, keeps saying nobody will turn up. Her mum and her brother Oscar are coming down from Manchester for it. Don't forget to message her the morning of to say good luck", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ming", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "exhibition opening", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Thursday at 7", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "anxious", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oscar", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming down from Manchester", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the morning of", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t028-058", "text": "Laura's husband lost his job last month, she says they're ok but money's tight. Not doing the big holiday this year", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Laura", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "lost his job", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "ok", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "money's tight", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "this year"}]}
