{"id": "t028-060", "text": "lunch w Suzanne Khan - her daughter Lucy just started uni in Glasgow, studying vet med, Suzanne is struggling with the empty nest thing, also she's been getting into wild swimming which is helping. Daughter home for reading week end of Oct. I need to send her that article about the swimming group in Clevedon", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Suzanne Khan", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lucy", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "uni in Glasgow", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "studying vet med", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Suzanne", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "struggling with the empty nest thing", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "wild swimming", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "home for reading week", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "end of Oct", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her that article about the swimming group in Clevedon", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "unspecified"}]}
